<p>The script will traverse all files in the Download directory and convert HEIC files to PNG format. The converted PNG files will be stored in the same directory, and the script will print the path of each converted PNG file. Note that the script only works on Mac, and you need to install the Xcode command line tools to get the <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">sips</code> command.</p>

